{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/31753","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:37.679276+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"Yes, `out_sharding=` is only meant for Explicit mode. For Auto mode, you have to use `with_sharding_constraint`.\n\nThe semantics for supporting both auto and explicit (and a mix of them) via `out_sharding` is pretty complicated and is not uniform.","created_at":"2025-09-11T17:50:32Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/31753#issuecomment-3282065406","id":3282065406,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/31753","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc7DoFf-","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/3282065406/reactions"},"updated_at":"2025-09-11T17:50:32Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/3282065406","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14262417?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yashk2810","id":14262417,"login":"yashk2810","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MjYyNDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"> The semantics for supporting both auto and explicit (and a mix of them) via out_sharding is pretty complicated and is not uniform\n\nThat's exactly what I'm trying to do...\n\nis there some documentation, or an internal helper you use to canonicalise the sharding internally I can look at?","created_at":"2025-09-11T17:53:01Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/31753#issuecomment-3282072060","id":3282072060,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/31753","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc7DoHH8","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/3282072060/reactions"},"updated_at":"2025-09-11T17:53:01Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/3282072060","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2407108?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PhilipVinc","id":2407108,"login":"PhilipVinc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MDcxMDg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"We don't canonicalize the sharding internally. We just error out :)\n\nBut if you want 